<title>UK: EIB adds 250 bln lire to 6.20 pct Mar 2002 bond.</title>
<headline>EIB adds 250 bln lire to 6.20 pct Mar 2002 bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following fungible bond has been announced by joint lead managers BNL and Caboto.</p>
<p> BORROWER   EUROPEAN INVESTMENT BANK</p>
<p> AMT   *250 BLN LIRE  COUPON     6.20	MATURITY    05.MAR.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  100.43    PAY DATE  **09.JUL.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.75	LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  AAA/AAA   DENOMS (K) 5-50	SALE LIMITS ***</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   IPMA 2</p>
<p> GOV LAW    LUX	 HOME CTRY  SUPRA     TAX PROVS   STANDARD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.50	SELL CONC  1.25	PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p> NOTES     *FUNGIBLE WITH OUTSTANDING 650 BLN LIRE LAUNCHED</p>
<p>		16.JAN.97 AND INCREASED ON 15.APR.97</p>
<p>	    **PLUS 124 DAYS ACCRUED INTEREST</p>
<p>	   ***GENERAL SALES LIMITS OF EIB WITH SPECIFICATIONS FOR</p>
<p>		ITALY ONLY</p>
<p>		ISSUED OFF ISSUERS DEBT ISSUANCE PROGRAMME</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
